  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing Food Insecurity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An assistance award to support a program that will address food insecurity in the Shinyanga and Tabora regions of Tanzania. This program will distribute daily meals to 14,400 school children in 80 schools for two school years. This program will also distribute nutrient supplements to approximately 2,300 pregnant and lactating women over the life of the program.</narrative>
  </description>
